#import "lib/report.typ": *
#show: report

#text(size: 24pt, weight: "bold")[Anscombe: when a calculation fails]

This companion deliberately contains runtime errors. It is excluded from the
successful reference build. A failed chain must stop without preventing the
other language from progressing. The generated Typst document contains the
diagnostics. A generated PDF can contain runtime errors: its existence alone
is not evidence of a successful scientific calculation.

